&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;UI-TARS Desktop is a native GUI agent for your local computer, driven by &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/bytedance/UI-TARS&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
