&lt;br&gt;
🖥️ Desktop Application &amp;nbsp&amp;nbsp
| &amp;nbsp&amp;nbsp 👓 &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/web-infra-dev/midscene&#34;&gt;Midscene (use in browser)&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp&amp;nbsp
